      "zh": "到第七天，日头未落以前，那城里的人对参孙说：有甚么比蜜还甜呢？有甚么比狮子还强呢？参孙对他们说：你们若非用我的母牛犊耕地，就猜不出我谜语的意思来。",
      "en": "On the seventh day, before the sun set, the men of the city said to him,“What is sweeter than honey?What is stronger than a lion?”He said to them,“If you had not plowed with my heifer,[NOTE:1] you would not have solved my riddle!”",
      "notes": [
